# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the root of the deploy.
#
# no-transform stops the Cloudflare proxy from rewriting pages on the way out:
# no Web Analytics beacon (which would break the colophon's "no third-party
# requests") and no email obfuscation (which replaces the address with
# "[email protected]" and only restores it with JavaScript). What a visitor
# receives is exactly what the build wrote, which is also what Vue hydrates.
# The rest of the value matches Pages' own default.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-transform
